== S1 adversarial parity: bash fold vs fmd on hand-written status lines
bash:
api-1	blocked	need token
cr-4	blocked	crlf note^M
fmd:
api-1	blocked	need token
cr-4	blocked	crlf note^M
PARITY(defaults)=match
overrides bash:
api-1	blocked	need token
db-2	blocked	migrate?
cr-4	blocked	crlf note
overrides fmd:
api-1	blocked	need token
db-2	blocked	migrate?
cr-4	blocked	crlf note
PARITY(overrides)=match
== S1b symlinked status file
bash=[] fmd=[]
PARITY(symlink)=match
== S2 mode readers agree (seam vs fmd mode)
'fmd\n'      seam=fmd     fmd=fmd     agree
'fmd \n'     seam=legacy  fmd=legacy  agree
'fmd\r\n'    seam=legacy  fmd=legacy  agree
'shadow\n'   seam=shadow  fmd=shadow  agree
'bogus\n'    seam=legacy  fmd=legacy  agree
'fmd'        seam=fmd     fmd=fmd     agree
FM_CONFIG_OVERRIDE: seam=shadow fmd=shadow agree
== S3 read-only: snapshot/check leave state untouched
adv	kind=ship	last_verb=blocked	last_at=-	branch=-	open=2
adv	open	api-1	blocked	need token
adv	open	cr-4	blocked	crlf note
fmd-check: mode=fmd tasks=1 open_decisions=2 beat_age_seconds=unknown
check exit=0
STATE_UNCHANGED=yes
== S4 no cargo, no binary: legacy skips, fmd-mode refuses
legacy home: rc=0 fm-fmd-check: skip mode=legacy (no fmd binary; bash is the supported posture)
fmd home: rc=1 fm-fmd-check: FAIL mode=fmd but no fmd binary is usable
== S5 defer gating
mode=fmd + binary -> defer rc=0
mode=fmd + no binary -> defer rc=1
mode=legacy + binary -> defer rc=1
== S6 upstream scripts untouched
upstream-owned scripts and bash classify lib: unchanged vs base
